          "type": "text",
          "id": "Ytk4H",
          "name": "NamingClarification",
          "fill": "#5A5A4F",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Naming clarification (locked) — `foreground` (alias `text`) = dark olive `#2D3A1F` in light mode, cream `#F1EEE4` in dark; it is the color pair text renders in by default. `primary` (alias `button`) = CTA-fill green `#5A743E` (ramp 500) light / `#8BA670` dark — NOT the text default, not a synonym for 'important'. Pressed state → ramp 700 (`#2C381E`).",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Sora",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "nbdGL",
          "name": "CoreNote",
          "fill": "#5A5A4F",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Marketplace note — the Background→Surface lightness gap is subtle (~7% light, ~4% dark). Fine for editorial content, a little flat for a dense product feed; re-check once real cards are in.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Sora",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
